<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10166"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dz<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dz<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 11:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Have you read the court transcript on kansas?? <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11027103.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/11027103.htm</a> <BR> <BR>Judge Greg Waller: Sir, you are Dennis L. Rader? <BR> <BR>Dennis L. Rader: Yes, sir. <BR> <BR>Waller: And as I understand it, you live at 6220 Independence in Park City, Kansas. Is that correct? <BR> <BR>Rader: That is correct, sir. <BR> <BR>I have always thought that BTK phone call&#40;Reporting nancy fox&#41; was with a fake accent,and with words that he wont use,now i see i was Wrong<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10166-->
<!--Post: 10190--><!--Time: 1109803781-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10190"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 02, 2005 - 2:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Not only that, but did you HEAR the voice when he said that?  It is him no doubt.  The pattern in his speech is like none other.  I wonder if his family ever heard that Nancy Fox recording when it was released?  <BR> <BR>It creeped me out when he spoke.  It is his voice.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10190-->
<!--Post: 10417--><!--Time: 1109925671-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10417"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bmodule_244@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Bmodule<!--/name--></b></a>
